# Compiled TypeScript output. The two exceptions below are SOURCE files that
# happen to end in .js/.sh — the CloudFront function and the instance's
# cloud-init script. Without the negations they are silently never committed,
# and the stack fails to synth on a fresh checkout.
*.js
*.d.ts
!lib/router-function.js
!lib/bootstrap.sh
